      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "description": "This armor protects you from harmful gasses, magical radiation, or extreme environments. These suits are also hermetically sealed with systems that purify the air and regulate temperature. \n\n- You are immune to the Harmful Battlefield Condition and any other dangerous environmental effects. \n- Also functions as Extreme Weather Clothing, protecting you from both heat and cold.\n\n**Coins** = Armor Price + 100",
    "data": {
      "subtype": "armor",
      "type": "Gear"
    },
    "name": "Armor Ability - Anti-Hazard",
    "version": 1
  },
  {
    "description": "Fitted with inflatable air bags, this armor prevents you from sinking in water. \n- You are exempt from any Checks or Contests your GM might require you to make attempting to stay afloat when wearing the armor. \n- Deliberately trying to submerge in the armor is problematic and requires a Might Check.\n\n**Coins** = Armor Price +50",
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "subtype": "armor"
    },
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
