      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "actions": [],
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "name": "Armor Ability - Integrated",
    "version": 1,
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "subtype": "armor"
    },
    "description": "This armor has a weapon or tool built into one of the arms. A weapon or tool can be fitted to the armors right or left arm.\n- Integrated items are limited to those that you could use with one hand.\n- For example, you cannot install a Large Mechanical Missile Weapon as it requires two hands to operate.\n- Integrated weapons do not have to be drawn, they are always ready to use.\n- Using an integrated item does not require your hand to use, enabling you to carry an additional item.\n- For example, an integrated lantern will allow you to still carry a shield and a sword.\n- An integrated item does not grant you an additional Action and you must choose to use the integrated item, if it normally requires an Action to use, or the item you are holding in your hand.\n\n**Coins** = Armor Price + Integrated Item Price +50",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "privacy": {
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "actions": [],
    "id": "iLentErwT8bwYM2snPW8",
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "data": {
      "subtype": "armor",
      "type": "Gear"
    },
    "description": "This armor is a work of art, either gilded, covered in gems, or sculpted like a fearsome beast. \n\n- This armor comes with a closed helmet that gives you an Aura of 12, or 14 for more expensive versions. \n- You can use your armors Aura in place of your own for Checks and Contests where an impressive physical appearance is a factor. \n\nMagnificent (Aura 12) **Coins** = Armor Price +25\n\nResplendent (Aura 14)\n**Coins** = Armor Price +50",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "actions": [],
    "id": "lex2nxvNsfpsghy20IBi",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "type": "none",
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Armor Ability - Magnificent"
  },
  {
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Armor Ability - Mechanical Motion",
    "description": "A system of levers, pistons, gears, and chains allow this armor to move under its own power. Warriors pilot these oversized suits rather than wear them. Only available for Heavy and Superheavy Armor. Despite the usual size restriction, Small Species can use Heavy and Superheavy Armor without penalty if fitted with Mechanical Motion. It takes an hour to adjust the armor to a pilots measurements. It will need to be adjusted again if a different pilot wants to use it. Mechanical Motion provides:\n  - +2 to your Might Aptitude.\n  - Supernatural Might.\n  - +1 to your Heart Total.\n  - The ability to use combat gear as if a Large Species.\n\nThis armor requires routine maintenance or it will lock up:\n- Your GM will determine when maintenance is required, usually after five or so Fights or a long, arduous Journey. \n- Maintenance requires an evening and a single use of a Gadgeteer Kit by someone with the Gadgeteering Crafting Discipline. \n- Failure to do so will result in a Snag on all actions attempted while wearing the armor.\n\n**Coins** = Armor Price x10",
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "subtype": "armor"
    },
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "type": "none",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [],
    "id": "EN99AfZSK0eRh14Cp2A3"
  },
  {
    "name": "Armor Ability - Shadowed",
    "version": 1,
    "description": "This armor is engineered to avoid noisy movement, and colored to help it blend into the shadows. Heavy duty protection need not come at the expense of stealth. \n- This armor provides a Minor Bonus (+2) when you are: Making rolls to hide in shadow or attempting Stealthy Movement.\n\n**Coins** = Armor Price + 15",
    "data": {
      "subtype": "armor",
      "type": "Gear"
    },
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
