        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    }
  },
  {
    "data": {
      "subtype": "armor",
      "type": "Gear"
    },
    "description": "The ostentatious spikes that cover this Armor are more than decoration. The wearer is harder to grab or swallow, endearing it to titan hunters all over the Outer World. \n\n- Any creature attempting to grab, squeeze, swallow or otherwise smash against you takes 1 Heart of Damage while doing so. \n- Your Unarmed attacks now strike like a Standard Weapon.\n\n**Coins** = Armor Price +75",
    "actions": [],
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
