      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "description": "Enormous bulwarks that are large enough to obscure their bearer completely. Effective, but large and difficult to carry.\n\n- You can Parry 1 Melee or Missile Attack per Fight. This includes spells or any special attacks that require an Attack roll.\n- Large Shields require one hand to use, so they affect your ability to use two-handed weapons.\n- Your Speed Rating is reduced by one step during a Fight.\n\n**Defense Bonus**: +2",
    "data": {
      "encumbrance": 2,
      "type": "Gear",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 35
      },
      "subtype": "armor"
    }
  },
  {
    "description": "Favored by fighters who want to use both hands, Small Shields are worn on your arm rather than held.\n\n- You can Parry 1 Melee Attack per Fight.\n- You may still use both hands when equipped with a Small Shield.\n\n**Defense Bonus**: 0",
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1,
