        "aspect": 1,
        "x": 0
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "Shield Ability - Assault",
    "version": 1,
    "data": {
      "subtype": "armor",
      "type": "Gear"
    },
    "description": "These shields are spiked, have a sharp edge, or are otherwise weaponized. Only available for Standard Shields. During a Fight, at the beginning of your Turn, you can choose to wield this shield as a Standard Weapon. Doing SO means:\n  - You will not benefit from the Shields Defense Bonus on your opponents next Turn.\n  - You can still use it to Parry.\n  - If you miss, you can Attack with another held weapon as if Dual Wielding.\n\n**Coins** = Shield Price + 20",
    "actions": [],
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "id": "nUVciHEVopCI27RePOJ5",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "name": "Shield Ability - Barricade",
    "version": 1,
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [],
    "id": "AmRvPPu4EqGfRVQ8sn1A",
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "subtype": "armor"
    },
    "description": "Immense bulwarks that can be propped up and used as cover. Popular with wielders of ranged weapons with slow reload times.\n\n- Only available for Large Shields.\n- Thanks to a kickstand, or other stabilizing device, this Shield can stand on its own. You can set it down and take cover behind it.\n\nWhile behind cover:\n- The Shield will automatically Parry all Missile attacks directed at you.\n- You can make Missile attacks from behind the Shield and still benefit from its Defense Bonus.\n- You cannot Parry Melee attacks.\n- You do not receive the Shields Defense Bonus for Melee Attacks.\n- Setting down or picking up the Shield does not require an Action, allowing you to Move and take Actions normally on your Turn.\n\n**Coins** = Shield Price x20"
  },
  {
    "image": {
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fw31tQ3sxsI8wCnkOEyUg.png?alt=media&token=e2891830-a6c5-4009-a34f-45573e8fe878",
