        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [],
    "id": "pbxa1fTcPVJuMhDnGghK",
    "description": "Alchemists make these thrown explosives, effective for taking out small groups.\n\n- A Grenade can be thrown up to 1 Battlefield Area away.\n- Anyone in the Battlefield Area where the Grenade detonates is a target.\n\n**Targets make a Deftness Check:**\n- **Failure:** They are Toppled and take 1 Heart of Damage.\n- **Success:** They avoid any ill effect.",
    "data": {
      "encumbrance": 1,
      "type": "gear",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 20
      },
      "subtype": "combustibles & chemicals"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Bomb",
    "image": {
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fw31tQ3sxsI8wCnkOEyUg.png?alt=media&token=e2891830-a6c5-4009-a34f-45573e8fe878",
      "tokenCrop": {
        "width": 100,
        "height": 100,
        "y": 0,
        "unit": "%",
        "aspect": 1,
        "x": 0
      }
    },
    "data": {
      "subtype": "combustibles & chemicals",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 45
      },
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 3
    },
    "description": "Slow to set off and indiscriminate, these powerful explosives are best kept for strategic demolitions rather than used during combat.\n\nIn a Fight, Bombs take an Action to set, and will detonate at the end of the next Round. Bombs affect everything, structures and individuals, up to 1 Battlefield Area (or 20 ft) away from the point of detonation.\n\nBombs do 8 Hearts of Damage to any objects classified as less than Very Hard. This is roughly equivalent to blowing a man-sized chunk out of a wall.\n\n**Targets make a Deftness Check:**\n- **Failure:** They are Toppled and take 8 Hearts of Damage.\n- **Success:** They are only Toppled.\n- Objects made from Magical Materials are immune to Damage inflicted by Bombs.",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [],
    "uses": {
      "max": 1
    },
    "id": "okdPP4GwveqnNgyluXEI",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "type": "none"
  },
  {
    "name": "Oil/Fuel",
    "version": 1,
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1,
      "cost": {
        "coins": 10
      },
      "subtype": "combustibles & chemicals"
    },
    "description": "Combustible fluids used to power simple machines or feed fires. Some Gear requires Oil/Fuel to function.\n\nIn a Fight, dousing something with Oil/Fuel and igniting will cause 1 Heart of Damage per Round.\n\n**Effects:**\n- When a foe reaches 0 Hearts they must roll on the Caustic/ Burning Injury Table.\n- When a combustible object reaches 0 Hearts, it is Sundered.\n- Your GM may add the Harmful Battlefield Area Condition to an Area set ablaze with Oil/Fuel.\n- Magical Materials are immune to mundane fire damage.",
    "id": "6nQXjGnWD312CnpySUYI",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "actions": [],
    "privacy": {
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
