    },
    "id": "hnau3iwPN1Co6a95uCjQ",
    "actions": [],
    "description": "Magical pastries that enhance one of your Aptitudes for a limited time... but beware the hangover.\n\n- You gain a +2 bonus to an Aptitude, depending on the type of cake, for the first 24 hours.\n- You suffer a -2 Penalty on the same Aptitude for the following 24 hours.\n- Cakes offered in Negotiation can provide a Major Bonus (+4).\n- 1 Cake provides 1 days nutrition.",
    "data": {
      "cost": {
        "stones": 0,
        "coins": 15
      },
      "subtype": "Consumables",
      "encumbrance": 0.1,
      "type": "Gear"
    }
  },
