    "id": "sZ1FOGSDT3GA6dIFpWHk",
    "description": "Simple foodstuffs intended for animal companions, but edible if desperate.\n\n- 1 Hardy Ration provides 1 day’s nutrition for your Mount, or Pack Beast.\n- 1 Hardy Ration can provide you with 1 day’s nutrition, but yuck!"
  },
