    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "description": "Calorie-dense fruits and candies, helpful in negotiations with the ravenous.\n\n- Treats offered in Negotiations can provide a Minor Bonus (+2).\n- 1 Treat provides 1 day’s nutrition.",
