      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Scanner",
    "description": "These technical wonders are salvaged and repaired by collectors and researchers. They are small boxes featuring a crystal display screen and are powered by ambient mana, allowing for continual use.\n\n- When activated, this Techno-Relic enables you to discern the presence and general location of any living creatures and sources of great energy (such as magic items, powerful undead, or synthetic life) within 50 ft.\n- During a Fight, operating and reading the Scanner requires the use of your Action.\n- Scanners make a loud, distinctive beeping noise when in use; this prevents Stealthy Movement while Exploring.",
    "id": "0wX0piN6TBQg8ABdOqwy",
    "actions": [],
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "description": "These smooth, tear-shaped stones are believed to be fossilized blood droplets from the Dark Dragon of the 3rd Cataclysm. Those who carry these profane relics are mistrusted.\n\n- When exposed, the Stone casts darkness up to 20 ft from the source. A Battlefield Area the stone is in becomes Obscured.\n- The Stone pushes actual sunlight away and provides shelter to those who cannot endure the daylight.\n- While a Stone touches your skin you temporarily gain + Dark Allegiance Point.",
    "data": {
      "encumbrance": 0.1,
      "type": "Gear",
      "cost": {
        "gems": 5
      },
      "subtype": "curiosities, artifacts, & gadgets"
    },
    "type": "none",
