      "level": "private"
    },
    "description": "Spell Engines are a kind of magical battery used to power large or powerful Magitech devices. Spell Engines are constructed from Magical Materials.\n\n**Charges:** Spell Engines contain Charges that are expended when operating powerful Magitech devices. The number of Charges required will depend on the individual device.\n\n**Charging a Spell Engine:** If you have a Magical Ability, you can redirect the mana you normally use to create the effect to charge the Spell Engine:\n- Put your hands on the Engine and expend your Magical Ability.\n- The expended Ability has no effect other than to charge the Spell Engine.\n- Expending 1 Standard Magical Ability creates 1 Charge.\n- Expending 1 Advanced Magical Ability creates 2 Charges.\n- The expended Ability cannot be used again for 24 hours.\n- Small Spell Engines hold 1 Charge. - Large Spell Engines hold 2 Charges.",
    "data": {
      "cost": {
        "gems": 2
      },
      "subtype": "curiosities, artifacts, & gadgets",
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "Star Gem",
    "version": 1,
    "image": {
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FBQlsCf5WYA9w49pKa52s.png?alt=media&token=e0706799-0f30-4968-9866-8038c0ad7444",
      "tokenCrop": {
        "height": 53,
        "width": 53,
        "y": 18.00000000000001,
        "unit": "%",
        "x": 23.333333333333346,
        "aspect": 1
      }
    },
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 0.1,
      "cost": {
        "gems": 3
      },
      "subtype": "curiosities, artifacts, & gadgets"
    },
    "description": "Fragments of the famed Star Shards, these gems produce a soothing amber glow. Considered a holy item in the Kingdom of Shard, they are often seen embedded in the jewellery and weaponry of the wealthy and powerful.\n\n- A Gem functions like other items listed in Illumination Gear, except it does not require Fuel and cannot be extinguished.\n- A Gem radiates actual sunlight and is therefore able to drive away creatures susceptible to daylight or bright light.\n- A Gem can be used to charge solar powered Techno-Relics and Magitech devices.\n- While a Gem touches your skin you temporarily gain +1 Bright Allegiance Point.",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "id": "KfOW7jkwYQXCVyHrKU4c",
    "actions": [],
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Lantern",
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1,
      "subtype": "Illumination",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 5
      }
    },
    "description": "These hand-held devices burn oil and other fuel for light. Common among the peasantry of the Wistful Dark.\n- Lanterns burn for 4 hours on 1 Unit of Oil, but can be snuffed and relit to conserve fuel.\n- It takes an Action to light or extinguish a Lantern.  .",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "actions": [],
    "id": "juBE7UJiW9u2hFm8K8L8",
