    "description": "These are tools intended for use in dangerous situations and are unlikely to be purchased by ordinary folk. As a result, they are expensive and will attract attention if carried around openly. Examples: Crowbar, grappling hook, pitons, ten foot pole. \n\n1-2 Slots (varies with item)",
