      "cost": {
        "coins": 6
      }
    },
    "description": "Large reference books and other bulky collections of knowledge.\n- Tomes contain knowledge of a single subject area. For example, The Colossal Creature Catalog or Understanding Akenian Architecture.\n- Your GM will answer any question covered by the Tomes subject area on a successful Check against the Tomes Insight score.\n\nInsight 12 to glean knowledge from the Tome about its Topic."
  },
