    "id": "2ctGWlaXCRkPQvwfFOSb",
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "data": {
      "subtype": "miscellaneous",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 75
      },
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 3
    },
    "description": "Barrels, sacks or crates of desirable goods bundled up for bulk sale. Adventurers can take advantage of their migratory nature and make a tidy profit transporting these goods from one region to another.\n\nExamples: A bushel of star plums (Wistful Dark), a barrel of moss whiskey (Buried Kingdom), a bolt of fine silk (Twilight Meridian), a box of Sol tobacco (Blazing Garden).\n\n- Unlike other items you carry, you will always find a buyer for your Trade Goods at full price in any place that can afford them.\n- A Trade Goods value increases to  when sold outside its Home Region. - For example, you may purchase a bushel of Star Plums in the Wistful Dark for 25 Coins, and sell it for  in the Blazing Garden."
  },
  {
    "image": {
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FRcHZiQI42FMgjT8N8Dsu.png?alt=media&token=ae34dd40-eaa1-4b7f-ac68-d7b022f22176",
