    "description": "These outfits incorporate easy-access utility pockets or pouches. This Outfit has pockets designed to carry the contents of a Specialists Kit. The pockets allow you immediate access to the Kit. Kits still need replenishing after use. \n\n**Outfit Only:** 8C\n\n**Outfit + Specialist Kit of buyers choice:**   50C",
