    "description": "While they wont hold up under scrutiny, Costumes allow you to imitate a member of a specific social class or profession. \n\n- You gain a Minor Bonus (+2) on rolls to keep from being recognized at a glance or within a crowded area. \n- A Costume can be worn over a Functional Outfit and torn away with an Action, destroying it.",
