    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1,
      "subtype": "outfits"
    },
    "description": "These clothes are worn and scruffy, making you look irrelevant or desperate. You cant buy a Tattered Outfit but can make one from salvaged scraps or rags.\n- You gain a Minor Bonus (+2) on rolls attempting to blend into a crowd, or when trying to convince someone you are not worth their time.\n- You suffer a Major Penalty (-4) on rolls to convince someone to take you seriously, and can attract negative attention in affluent areas."
  },
  {
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "actions": [],
    "description": "Small, single-room homes found in rural settlements or as standalone shelters in the wilderness. Built with local techniques and materials, they range from the eggshaped pods of Shard to the floating lodges of the Galvanus Archipelago.\n\n- A Hut can comfortably house 2 people and their possessions, 4 in cramped conditions.",
    "id": "Wk1rQr327yuBMjlgpRZV",
