        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "id": "W7fL0VIrkAzxErCAbCdn",
    "description": "Boasting 4-6 rooms, and occasionally a basement or second floor, townhouses are often occupied by wealthier families. Less characterful than improvised huts, but more solidly constructed.\n\n- A Town House can comfortably house 4 people and their possessions, 8 in cramped conditions.",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "actions": []
  },
  {
