    "name": "Property - Workshop",
    "version": 1,
    "description": "Crafters need access to a Workshop to create their complicated constructions.\n\n- Workshops are big enough to accommodate 2 workers at once, and stocked with tools and materials for crafting.\n- Workshops are specific to one Crafting Discipline, and include tools and enough supplies for 10 crafting sessions.\n\n**To Restock**: 30 Coins",
    "id": "z1ZwwNfZjHPzxICCWmAS",
    "actions": [],
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "name": "Service - Crafting",
    "version": 1,
    "image": {
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FvswEvl9xAv6wlsNGxNHI.png?alt=media&token=a0a97c01-66b0-4656-8149-1759bde7d7c2",
      "tokenCrop": {
        "width": 100,
        "height": 100,
        "y": 0,
        "unit": "%",
        "aspect": 1,
        "x": 0
      }
    },
    "data": {
      "type": "gear",
      "subtype": "services"
    },
    "description": "If you want a bespoke weapon or potion created, or need your favorite suit of armor patched up, then commission a Crafter.\n\n- **Fixing Standard Gear:** Costs 50% of the list price of the chosen item (rounded up).\n- **Commissioning Customized Gear:** Costs 50% more than the calculated list price (rounded up).\n- **Crafting Imbued Gear:** Refer to the costs of Crafting Imbued Gear, then add an extra 50% (rounded up).\n - Note that not all Crafters are able to work with, or have access to, the Magic Materials and Additives required to make Imbued Gear.",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "66IoFFbM65thC61tKsdi",
    "actions": [],
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
  },
  {
    "id": "x1lCxWahHRzrWwD5oujX",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [],
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "type": "none",
    "data": {
      "type": "gear",
      "subtype": "services"
    },
    "description": "Without access to an air or seagoing\nvessel, intercontinental travel is\nimpossible. Fortunately, merchants and\nsailors with large enough ships will offer\npassage, for a price.\n\n- When on an intercontinental\nvoyage you can participate in 1\nDowntime Activity, limited to what\nis available to you on the vessel.\n- Pets travel free, but a seat must be\npaid for Mounts & Pack Beasts.\n- You can choose to assist the crew\non the voyage. This halves your\nfare, but forfeits any chance of\nindulging in a Downtime Activity.\n- You can try to convince the captain\nof the vessel to take you into\nuncharted territory, but this will\ncost you double.\n\n**Maritime Vessel (Food & passage)**: 8 Coins per seat\n\n**Sky Ship (Food & passage)**: 16 Coins per seat\n\n**Other considerations**:\n- Trailblazing = Cost x2\n- Working = Cost ÷2",
    "image": {
      "tokenCrop": {
        "unit": "%",
        "aspect": 1,
        "x": 0,
        "height": 100,
        "width": 100,
        "y": 0
      },
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fl7Kl7p0i94vvkuKazk5q.png?alt=media&token=d1a98f47-4f11-4484-a723-ca42d0875757"
    },
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Service - Intercontinental Travel"
  },
  {
    "data": {
      "subtype": "services",
      "type": "gear"
    },
    "description": "While there are many local runners, they aren’t much help when it comes to sending messages or items to another continent. Fortunately, the Paw Post provides adventurers with a reliable postal service. Paw Post Stations appear in many surprisingly remote places.\n\n- Paw Post Stations will deliver\nmessages and items to any other\nPaw Post Station, via their network\nof relay teams.\n- Deliveries are guaranteed to arrive\nwithin 2 months.\n- Deliveries are insured. In the event\nof loss/damage a full refund\nis offered.\n\n**Membership**: Allows 1 free delivery a month.\nFurther services must be paid\nfor normally.\n\n**Deliver Message (any distance)**: 1 Coin\n\n**Deliver Item in the same Region**: 50 Coins per Item (3 Slot Max.)\n\n**Deliver Item to another  Region**: 1 Gem per Item (3 Slot Max.)\n\n**Membership Card**: 5 Gems a year",
    "id": "g33g3dkIyGTN3X431UJn",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "actions": [],
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "type": "none",
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Service - Paw Post",
    "image": {
      "tokenCrop": {
        "width": 59.42622950819676,
        "height": 48.333333333333336,
        "y": 3.333333333333334,
        "unit": "%",
        "aspect": 1,
        "x": 2.04918032786885
      },
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FmlOLAdfxMiG4pfhZZDRP.png?alt=media&token=661f4696-090a-4ff6-823e-ad6ee2492ca9"
    }
  },
  {
    "data": {
      "subtype": "services",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 5
      },
      "type": "gear"
    },
    "description": "Opera houses, underground spas, and locations that focus on personal enjoyment are a rare treat in Outer World.\n\nThere are two kinds of Recreational Attraction, each with a perk:\n- **Relaxing:** Allows you to perform both the Socializing and Heal an Injury Downtime Activities simultaneously.\n- **Entertaining:** Gives you an Edge\non your Socializing rolls\nduring Downtime.",
    "id": "SpMkeellImQAfsXRYcBU",
    "actions": [],
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "type": "none",
