    },
    "id": "UJY3LkHo1f6I949gx9w1",
    "description": "You’ve been wounded and your priority on entering town is to find the local physician (or mechanic!) to patch you up.\n\n- During Downtime you can pay a\nphysician, or Gadgeteer if you are a Bio-Mechanoid, to remove an Injury of your choice.\n - This paid treatment can work in\nconjunction with Heal an Injury, enabling you to heal 2 Injuries during Downtime.\n\n- Severed or Mutilated limbs can be replaced with Prosthetics. Not all treatment centers will have\naccess to prosthetics, or be able to conduct this type of surgery.\n\n**Remove Injury**: 5 Coins\n\n**Prosthetic Graft**: 5 Gems",
    "data": {
      "cost": {
        "coins": 5
      },
      "subtype": "services",
      "type": "gear"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "Service - Workshop Rental",
    "version": 1,
    "image": {
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FWHFsfZ4dVekDqSkZP5s2.png?alt=media&token=2954089a-8cfe-4ee1-8e47-6dcc79ee70c8",
