        "height": 76.66666666666667,
        "x": 7.655125899280573,
        "aspect": 1,
        "unit": "%"
      }
    },
    "description": "Crafters need an appropriate space to practice their art. Fortunately, the required Workshops can be rented from trade organizations, universities, local governments, or willing individuals.\n\n- Workshops can be rented for a Downtime Crafting session or a single Repair.\n- Materials are not included in the price and must be provided by the craftsman.\n- Some Workshops will have basic Materials and Additives for sale, but exotic items will be scarce.\n- Using a High-end Workshop grants you a Minor Bonus (+2) on your Crafting roll.\n\n**Basic**: 3 Coins per Downtime Session.\n\n**High-end**: 20 Coins per Downtime Session.",
    "data": {
      "cost": {
        "gems": 20
      },
      "subtype": "services",
      "type": "gear"
    },
