    "description": "For assisting the Injured.\n\n- Some Abilities require the use of a\nKit to be performed successfully.\n-  single use of a Kit is expended\neach time an Ability is attempted.\n- Kits can be used 10 times before\nthey need replenishment.\n- A Specialist Kit can only perform\nthe function it was intended for."
