        "gems": 3
      },
      "type": "gear",
      "encumbrance": 2
    },
    "description": "These difficult to master gliders are rare treasures coveted by adventurers and collectors alike. Their Sky Steel frames make them super light, and while they are too cumbersome to carry, they can be pulled along like a kite with a little effort.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot.\n- Fuel: Thermal Winds\n- Traversable Terrain: Any Terrain\n- Take-off requires a running start\n\n**Manoeuvring**\n- Landing requires a Deftness Check.\n- Making a difficult manoeuvre, such as flying through a crowded space, or stabilizing the Breeze Rider after being hit, requires the driver to make a Deftness Check.\n- Failing a Deftness roll to land or manoeuvre results in a crash and the rider suffers a Falling/Impact Injury.\n\n**Inventory Slots**:\n- Breeze Riders can carry a Small, Medium, or Large pilot as long as they are not Overburdened.\n- An additional passenger can hang onto the glider, but piloting rolls suffer a Snag.\n- Pets can ride along without inflicting this penalty on the pilot.",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "vjnHrgx3gRF88ya8i9gd",
    "actions": [],
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "type": "none",
