    "image": {
      "tokenCrop": {
        "y": 0,
        "width": 79.36507936507937,
        "x": 7.1428571428571415,
        "aspect": 1,
        "height": 100,
        "unit": "%"
      },
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fx3SG9w9N2OWbQphPnEe7.png?alt=media&token=21a877f2-e6a0-46b5-b255-b6f517f585ea"
    },
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "actions": [],
    "id": "9HaCfbHYexmKyTHqB4e6",
    "description": "A small, typically one-beast, cart employed by merchants, farmers and nomads.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 driver.\n- Fuel: A Cart needs to be tethered\nto a Pack Beast, Mount, or a PC\nwith Supernatural Might!\n- Carts can be chained together in a train but require one beast per cart.\n- Traversable Terrain: If Trailblazing you are slowed to foot speed.\n- Journey Time: If pulled by a PC the distance covered in one day is the same as if travelling by foot.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 80 Slots"
  },
  {
    "image": {
      "tokenCrop": {
        "unit": "%",
        "x": 8.767772511848342,
        "aspect": 1,
        "height": 100,
        "width": 61.84834123222749,
        "y": 0
      },
      "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FnpFHcUd46TMshuInVtH6.png?alt=media&token=30fb697a-1f47-4ec2-81ca-d23517cdbf50"
    },
    "name": "Vehicle - Cloud Breaker",
    "version": 1,
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "satPXjcNe9rbqTlMet9i",
    "actions": [],
    "description": "These small sky ships are used by\nthe wealthy for island hopping in the Galvanus Archipelago. The vessel’s hull is constructed from Sky Steel or Floatstone, which keeps the craft perpetually aloft as well as magically resistant to wear and tear. Cloud Breakers come with exquisitely decorated anchors which bear the mark of their constructor’s yard. For locomotion, sky sailors harness the winds in the same way as their marine cousins.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot and 1 assistant.\n- Fuel: Sails harness the wind.\n- Traversable Terrain: Any.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 50 Slots",
    "data": {
      "subtype": "vehicle",
      "cost": {
        "gems": 12
      },
      "type": "gear"
    }
  },
