    "description": "Single person boats used for fishing. Easily carried, but not for open waters.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot.\n- Fuel: PC-powered\n- Traversable Terrain: Waterways and other calm waters, such as lakes, rivers, or stretches of coastline.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 10 Slots",
    "id": "QJKMySD71LTpCLSGEbRA"
  },
