      "type": "gear",
      "subtype": "vehicle",
      "cost": {
        "gems": 6
      }
    },
    "description": "This small sailing vessel, employed around the Twilight Meridian, has become popular among adventurers as it only requires a relatively small crew.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot and 2 assistants.\n- Fuel: Sails harness the wind, but\nemergency oars require PC-power.\n- Traversable Terrain: Open seas.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 80 Slots",
