  {
    "description": "These versatile craft float just above the ground, making travel across challenging terrain much faster.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot.\n- Fuel: Skimmers include a Large\nSpell Engine. 1 Charge powers the vessel for three days.\n- Traversable Terrain: They glide\nacross land and sea, and are not\nslowed by Difficult Terrain.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 35 Slots",
    "data": {
