    },
    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "actions": [],
    "description": "Single person, pedal-powered machines used for speedily getting around urban areas. Popular with Paw Post couriers.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot.\n- Fuel: PC-powered\n- Traversable Terrain: Designed to travel along Roads, you are slowed to foot speed on other types of land Routes.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 10 Slots",
    "id": "6NGZxCBfFNSFJskPHrvh"
  },
  {
