    "id": "EQS0ZdXWveDf9Ip8TESn",
    "actions": [],
    "description": "The first walkers were created by Goblin engineers who wanted a means of tirelessly traversing the undulating tunnels of the Buried Kingdom. The pilot, and any passengers, sit inside a metal cockpit which controls its multiple mechanical limbs. Walkers are not nimble, but their long strides allow them to easily move over terrain that would normally slow you down, like a swamp or rocky landscape.\n\n**Vehicle Use**\n- Crewing: 1 pilot.\n- Fuel: Walkers include a Large\nSpell Engine. 1 Charge powers the machine for one day.\n- Traversable Terrain: Any\noverland terrain. Walkers are not slowed by Difficult Terrain, as their long legs negate uneven surfaces.\n\n**Inventory Slots**: 25 Slots",
    "data": {
      "subtype": "vehicle",
      "cost": {
        "gems": 6
      },
      "type": "gear"
    },
