      ]
    },
    "description": "Long weapons that allow their wielders to make wide, dangerous strokes that hit several enemies at once. When wielding one-handed you suffer a Minor Penalty (-2) on Attack rolls, Attack Stunts, & Combat Tricks.\n\n**Weapon Ability — Deadly Sweep:** You can hit two enemies in the same Battlefield Area with one Attack. Make a single Attack roll, and apply the result to both enemies.\n\n**Extra Damage**: +1 Heart for Attack roll totals of 20 and above.",
    "data": {
      "cost": {
        "coins": 25
      },
      "subtype": "weapons",
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 3
    },
