    "name": "Weapon - Concealed",
    "version": 1,
    "id": "gjFRJcMAOG1ijKKtP1GI",
    "uses": {
      "max": 0
    },
    "actions": [
      {
        "version": 2,
        "details": [
          {
            "value": {
              "description": "Range: Melee\nDamage: 1\nThreshold: 22\n\nDrawing and striking with a Concealed Weapon is one Action.\n\n**Weapon Ability, Sneaky Swipe:**\nIf your target isn’t aware of your Concealed Weapon you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight.\n- Your Target must be in the same Battlefield Area as you, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush.\n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush."
            },
            "visibility": "full",
            "type": "description"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "value": {
              "image": {
                "tokenCrop": {
                  "x": 0,
