    "type": "none",
    "creator": "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2",
    "data": {
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1,
      "cost": {
        "coins": 5
      },
      "subtype": "weapons"
    },
    "description": "Concealed Weapons are usually small SO that they can be hidden about your person with ease. Unlike other arms, Concealed Weapons are not immediately visible. \n\nDuring a Fight, drawing and striking with a Concealed Weapon can be performed in one Action.\n\n**Weapon Ability — Sneaky Swipe:** If your target isnt aware of your Concealed Weapon you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight. \n- Your Target must be in the same Battlefield Area as you, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush. \n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush.\n\n**Extra Damage**: +1 Heart for Attack roll totals of 22 and above."
  },
