    "description": "These heavy weapons require both hands to use. Enjoyed by warriors who wish to quickly dispatch their enemies. When wielding one-handed you suffer a Minor Penalty (-2) on Attack rolls, Attack Stunts, & Combat Tricks.\n\n**Weapon Ability — Crushing Blow:** You do 2 Hearts of damage, instead of 1, on a successful Attack.\n\n**Extra Damage**: +1 Heart for Attack roll totals of 20 and above.  10",
