  {
    "data": {
      "subtype": "weapons",
      "cost": {
        "coins": 2
      },
      "type": "Gear",
      "encumbrance": 1
    },
    "description": "These small, hand-held weapons are shaped and balanced specifically for throwing. Sneaks love them.\n\n**Range**: 1 Battlefield Area away.\n\n**Loading Time**: None, but the weapon must be retrieved before reuse.\n\n**Weapon Ability — Hidden Fangs:** If your target isnt aware of your Thrown Weapon, you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight. \n- Targets must be in Range, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush. \n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush.\n\n**Extra Damage**: +1 Heart for Attack roll totals of 22 and above.",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "actions": [
      {
        "version": 2,
        "type": "",
        "details": [
          {
            "visibility": "full",
            "value": {
              "description": "Range: 1 Area\nDamage: 1\nThreshold: 22\nLoading Time: None\n\n**Weapon Ability, Hidden Fangs:** \nIf your target isn’t aware of your Thrown Weapon, you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight.\n- Targets must be in Range, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush (􀂴 p252).\n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush."
            },
            "type": "description"
          },
          {
            "visibility": "full",
